nteractive Brokers and אינטראקטיב ישראל ('אין נתון')","Screens 10–13, didn't get there"],"unsure_meaning":["נאמן 0.025%","דמי משמרת","The minus percentages in the fund list (−0.04%, −0.54%)","'הזוג הבא בתור' and '−1,030 ₪ לעומת הבחירה שלכם'","The difference between קרן מחקה and קרן סל here","(4A)","The purple dotted underlines under the numbers"],"not_found":["The final amount for my 30,000 ₪ (I didn't change the fields)","A simple explanation of what the first thing to do is (how to open an account at Psagot)"],"findings":[{"what":"The final amount is calculated on 10,000 + 500 by default. Someone who doesn't change it takes away a number that isn't theirs.","where":"Screen 1–2, amount fields and the 86,045 ₪ card"},{"what":"Minus signs on all the funds look like a loss. It's scary and unclear.","where":"Screen 7–8, the fund list"},{"what":"Two different numbers for how much more the fund costs (1,390 vs 1,030).","where":"Screen 2–3 vs screen 7"},{"what":"The fund name (אי.בי.אי) appears small, in a box in the middle of grey text, and I almost missed what I'm actually buying.","where":"Screen 3, under 'כל החשבונות'"},{"what":"Too many banks that look alike, with notes about other prices for young people and soldiers. Hard to tell if one of them is cheaper for me.","where":"Screen 4–5"},{"what":"Words like נאמן and דמי משמרת without an explanation next to them.","where":"Screen 6–7"}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3731,"cache_read_input_tokens":17540,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3731},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d354a545-31f3-443a-b2a1-ae77b6069ab1","uuid":"c360b9d4-065a-41b7-827d-a2b7a284afdf","timestamp":"2026-11-06T